# Wave T55 (Wildreach kit): cookpot — the outpost kitchen's pot: a black iron pot on a tripod over a small fire, steam curling up, a ladle resting at its side. Stands at TRAIL COOK BORIN's west shoulder — the painting's steaming pots and the town sign's kitchen realized at the cook's own post (his dialogue is the kitchen: 'I feed everyone who walks in standing up'). Fully opaque; the town grass is baked in at its measured colours (tg-pastoria #008100/#003f00). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T55-WILDREACH-PLAN.md §3.2/§5.)
